-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Original work and modifications
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an adaptation of the "Grecko" restaurant website template by
Marios Sofokleous (PictureElement), https://github.com/PictureElement/grecko,
released under the MIT License above.

Modifications by Katherine Costa (2026), released under the same license:
- Rebranded as the fictitious restaurant "Casa do Sabor" (name, logo, favicon,
  colors), with a Brazilian cuisine theme.
- Page texts and menu content rewritten in Brazilian Portuguese.
- Typography changed to "DM Serif Display" (Google Fonts).
- New photos for the hero slider, events, testimonials, menu items and page
  backgrounds, stored locally in media/ instead of the original Cloudinary
  account.
- Style and layout changes in css/main.css.
- Web app manifest and favicons updated; asset paths adjusted for GitHub Pages.

